        },
        "description": "An intermediate wizard and a member of [Taylor](https://anilist.co/character/242932/Taylor)'s party, alongside [Keith](https://anilist.co/character/136043/Keith) and [Dust](https://anilist.co/character/136046/Dust).\n\nRin is a highly capable magic user, although she is humble and describes herself as a rookie wizard. She is also a very direct and honest person, and although she's usually calm, she knows how to hit someone back when she is teased. Her level-headedness compared to the boys in her party often leads to her getting Dust out of trouble and scolding him for his actions.\n\nDespite her strict demeanor however she is a pleasant person, and at times shows genuine kindness and concern for Dust as well.",
